<title>JAPAN: Mandom slips on rating cut.</title>
<headline>Mandom slips on rating cut.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Mandom Corp slipped on Thursday morning in over-the-counter trade, still depressed by a ratings cut the previous day, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0142 GMT, the shares of the cosmetics firm stood at 1,340 yen after closing at 1,440 yen on Wednesday.</p>
